# Cloudflare Pages reads this file.
#
# By default it tells browsers to keep everything for four hours, which means
# a change can be live and still not show up. Instead: always ask whether the
# page has changed (a quick "no" is cheap), and only cache the things whose
# names would change anyway if their contents did.

/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/thumbs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/logo.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
